+# Billing questions
+
+Billing support distinguishes refund questions from invoice questions through `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+
+- A message containing the lowercase text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`.
+- Any other message passed to the classifier is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The classifier only labels a question. It does not verify account or invoice facts, decide refund eligibility, issue refunds, change invoices, or otherwise resolve a billing dispute.

